> [][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]Negative Pneumatic Toothed Clutch with Front Toothing, Closed with Springs Pressure, with Transmission.
• The power supply (approx. 6 bars) disconnects the toothed clutch.
